      },
      "lineNbr": 135,
      "author": {
        "id": 3469321
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-11-01T06:53:01Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Currently TYPE_L2CAP_LE is system only API, making it public would also require me to keep it under the new flag.\nAnd that forces all the internal functions which are using TYPE_L2CAP_LE also need to be under new flag. that would break the compatibility as It would requite new flag to be enabled for certain APIs. this is undesirable.\n\nInitially I wanted to that way, but figured out it opens up concerns. this new flag is reflecting its LE transport, we should be able to deprecate TYPE_L2CAP_LE in future.",
      "parentUuid": "320be37c_b4a5ddda",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 135,
        "startChar": 4,
        "endLine": 135,
